WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.633 --> 00:00:02.635
[music playing]

00:00:04.137 --> 00:00:06.940
JANE GOODALL: When I
first went to Gombe,

00:00:07.006 --> 00:00:09.376
it was the most amazing
time of my life.

00:00:25.358 --> 00:00:26.893
DR. ANTHONY COLLINS:
One of the things

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:32.899
which is important for her is to
get away and retouch her roots.

00:00:32.966 --> 00:00:34.434
JANE GOODALL: Have
to go this side.

00:00:38.037 --> 00:00:39.873
DR. ANTHONY COLLINS: Everything
which is happening today

00:00:39.939 --> 00:00:43.309
is because of the experiences
she had in the first.

00:00:43.376 --> 00:00:45.645
And she needs to take
strength from that.

00:00:48.615 --> 00:00:50.683
Ah, better.

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:52.819
DR. ANTHONY COLLINS: To
be alone in the forest

00:00:52.886 --> 00:00:56.222
is what matters to her.

00:00:56.289 --> 00:00:59.759
[light music]

00:01:20.980 --> 00:01:22.415
JANE GOODALL: Out
in the forest, I

00:01:22.482 --> 00:01:26.853
had this very strong feeling
of a great spiritual power

00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:28.922
out there.

00:01:28.988 --> 00:01:33.259
It was the kind of feeling
that I sometimes have in one

00:01:33.326 --> 00:01:37.197
of the old cathedrals where
people have been to worship

00:01:37.263 --> 00:01:39.566
year after year after year.

00:01:47.440 --> 00:01:51.845
The chimpanzees I knew in the
old days are almost all gone.

00:01:51.911 --> 00:01:56.483
But one of the ones who was
my real, I'd say, friend

00:01:56.549 --> 00:01:57.283
was Gremlin.

00:01:59.719 --> 00:02:02.255
The last time I
actually saw Gremlin,

00:02:02.322 --> 00:02:04.991
she came right up to me
and looked into my eyes.

00:02:05.058 --> 00:02:08.728
I mean, of course they recognize
us just as we recognize them.

00:02:15.468 --> 00:02:19.405
And I've always had a strange
connection with animals.

00:02:19.472 --> 00:02:22.675
I connect with
people with words.

00:02:22.742 --> 00:02:25.478
With animals, it's
more mind to mind.

00:02:28.615 --> 00:02:32.085
So many things in my life
seem to be coincidence,

00:02:32.151 --> 00:02:34.621
but I'm not sure I
believe that anymore,

00:02:34.687 --> 00:02:37.190
because things happen--

00:02:37.257 --> 00:02:38.892
I think they seem to
happen for a reason.

00:02:43.129 --> 00:02:46.533
[chimps calling]

